# Model workflow (director lock)

For this project and as the standing preference for agent work here:

1. **Planning / goal-setting / prioritization** — use higher-effort **Other Models** first (Claude Opus or Sonnet thinking-high/xhigh, GPT sol xhigh) via Task subagents before choosing what to build.
2. **Implementation** — delegate to **Cursor Models** (Composer / Composer Fast) unless the work cannot be delegated (auth, live browser playtest, PR registration, or the planner already failed).
3. On “keep going” / roadmap picks: plan first, then code. Do not invent parallel game trees.
